OL,3,A'What happened here was not human':
OL,4,AIsrael marks three years since 7
OL,5,AOctober attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tel Aviv, people stopped their cars
OL,8,Fto pay their respects - the city will
OL,9,Fhold a ceremony later tonight
OL,11,FAt the site of the Nova music festival,
OL,12,Fwhere 378 people were killed and 44
OL,13,Ftaken hostage, the mother of one victim
OL,14,Fsays the attacks were "dystopic,
OL,15,Funimaginable"
OL,17,F"What happened here was not human,"
OL,18,Fsays Ahuva Yavin Mayze, whose daughter
OL,19,Fwas shot dead at the festival
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
