OL,3,A'What happened here was not human':
OL,4,AIsrael marks three years since 7
OL,5,AOctober attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn response to the 7 October attacks,
OL,8,FIsrael launched a military offensive in
OL,9,FGaza in which more than 74,200 people
OL,10,Fhave been killed, according to the
OL,11,FHamas-run health ministry
OL,13,FIsrael does not allow international
OL,14,Fnews organisations, including the BBC,
OL,15,Finto Gaza to report freely
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
